# Pinned SHA-256 digests for Whitaker Clippy snapshot bundles.
# Format: sha256sum manifest (digest, two spaces, asset filename), the asset
# being whitaker-clippy-snapshot-<commit>.bundle.
# Each digest is computed from the bundle downloaded from the published
# release and cross-checked against the release .sha256 sidecar. Regenerate
# only from an independent download; never copy a digest from the sidecar alone.
# A line may end with an installer version: the same commit's bundle is rebuilt
# for each release and is not byte-identical across them, so a release whose
# bytes differ pins its own digest, and that line wins for that version.
11e0d766aa12f78c06807d8f4203663279154844ffbfe4e89e8ce59195b2f91f  whitaker-clippy-snapshot-e4608a25c2e20116fbc1e97a51a73f094a1db7a1.bundle
